augh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/1981758210/reactions"},"updated_at":"2024-03-06T20:50:42Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/1981758210","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22101546?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/qedawkins","id":22101546,"login":"qedawkins","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTAxNTQ2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"## Problem description + Reproducer\r\nSimple elementwise add\r\n```mlir\r\n!tensor_t = tensor<4xf32>\r\n\r\nfunc.func @forward(\r\n    %A : !tensor_t, %B : !tensor_t) -> !tensor_t {\r\n  %C = tensor.empty() : !tensor_t\r\n  %0 = linalg.add ins(%A, %B : !tensor_t, !tensor_t)\r\n                     outs(%C : !tensor_t) -> !tensor_t\r\n  return %0 : !tensor_t\r\n}\r\n```\r\nCompile + run and try to roundtrip the expected output with the same vmfb\r\n```\r\niree-compile elementwise.mlir \\\r\n    --iree-llvmcpu-target-triple=x86_64-unknown-linux \\\r\n    --iree-hal-target-backends=llvm-cpu \\\r\n    -o /tmp/elementwise.vmfb\r\n\r\niree-run-module \\\r\n    --module=/tmp/elementwise.vmfb \\\r\n    --device=local-task \\\r\n    --function=forward \\\r\n    --input=4xf32=1.0 \\\r\n    --input=4xf32=2.0 \\\r\n    --output=@output.npy\r\n\r\niree-run-module \\\r\n    --module=/tmp/elementwise.vmfb \\\r\n    --device=local-task \\\r\n    --function=forward \\\r\n    --input=4xf32=1.0 \\\r\n    --input=4xf32=2.0 \\\r\n    --expected_output=4xf32=@output.npy\r\n```\r\n\r\nProduces the following failure to match\r\n```\r\nEXEC @forward\r\nEXEC @forward\r\n[FAILED] result[0]: element at index 0 (3) does not match the expected (2.23669E+08); expected that the view is equal to contents of a view of 4xf32\r\n  expected:\r\n4xf32=2.23669E+08 1.23875E-40 3.48335E-15 4.48986E+21\r\n  actual:\r\n4xf32=3 3 3 3\r\n```\r\n\r\nUsing `.bin` files instead of `.npy` files works as expected.","closed_at":"2024-03-06T20:47:27Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22101546?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/qedawkins","id":22101546,"login":"qedawkins","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTAxNTQ2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":6,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/16686/comments","created_at":"2024-03-06T20:41:10Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/16686/events","htm